WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.969
I have a Clicky that keeps my job search moving.

00:02.969 --> 00:04.809
One short update, every morning.

00:05.009 --> 00:07.947
Then my friend got HeyClicky, and asked the big question.

00:07.947 --> 00:10.684
HeyClicky can build a Clicky from a few questions.

00:10.684 --> 00:14.790
But I already run one that does a real job, and there's no way to share it.

00:15.390 --> 00:16.927
So I built Share-a-Clicky!

00:16.927 --> 00:18.061
Pick a shared Clicky.

00:18.061 --> 00:23.027
See what it does, which apps it needs, and about how many agent messages it uses each month.

00:23.027 --> 00:26.476
Job Hunter runs daily, so it says up front that it needs Pro.

00:26.476 --> 00:29.930
Copy the setup. Paste it into New Clicky. Connect the apps.

00:29.930 --> 00:32.237
About twenty seconds later, it's ready.

00:32.237 --> 00:34.070
And my invite link comes along.

00:34.620 --> 00:38.239
It also works inside HeyClicky, as a custom connector.

00:38.239 --> 00:39.378
One URL, no code.

00:39.378 --> 00:43.600
Then any Clicky can list shared Clickys and pass along a setup.

00:44.200 --> 00:46.207
Testing it live, I found two gaps.

00:46.207 --> 00:48.931
Local connectors stop after the first message.

00:48.931 --> 00:51.293
And a Clicky can't create a Clicky yet.

00:51.293 --> 00:53.654
So install is one paste, not one click.

00:54.254 --> 00:57.016
Share-a-Clicky. Start with a Clicky that already works.
